One of The Prestigious Residential Complex in Westen Suburbs. A Well-Maintained Society is Suitable For Families.\n\n#### Available\n\n##### 2BHK | Residential Apartment | In Malad West | on Rent\n\n## Amenities & Features\n\nClub House\n\nGym\n\nIntercom\n\nJogging Tread\n\nRain Harvesting\n\nVastu Compliant\n\nGetting Here\n\n## Location & Nearby Connectivity\n\nNearest Metro\n\n**Malad West Metro Station**\n\nNearest Railway\n\n**Goregaon Railway Station**\n\nNearest Landmark\n\n**Mindspace Junction**\n\nNearby Malls\n\n**Evershie Mall Malad****Inorbit Mall Malad****Infinity Mall Malad**\n\nHealthcare Nearby\n\n**Cloudnine Hospital**\n\nBusiness Hubs Nearby\n\n**Mindspace Malad**\n\nNeighbourhood\n\n## About Malad West\n\nMalad West is a well-connected western suburb location with residential options across ready, resale and new-launch properties. Buyers usually compare projects here by carpet area, possession stage, connectivity, amenities and budget.For current availability in this neighbourhood, speak with Divya Housing Agency and compare verified options before booking a visit.\n\n [View all properties in Malad West →](https://divyahousingagency.com/area/malad-west/)\n\n## Frequently Asked Questions — Evershine Grandeur\n\n  What is the current price of Evershine Grandeur? + \n\nThe listed price is ₹45,000++. Prices are indicative and exclude stamp duty, registration and other applicable charges.\n\n   Which configuration is this listing in Evershine Grandeur? + \n\nThis listing is shown as a 2 BHK with carpet area of 761 SqFt. Current unit availability should be confirmed before scheduling a visit.\n\n   Where is Evershine Grandeur located? + \n\nEvershine Grandeur is located in Malad West, Mumbai. Please confirm the exact visit location and current availability before planning a visit.\n\n   How can I schedule a site visit for Evershine Grandeur? + \n\nYou can call or WhatsApp to confirm availability, latest pricing and a suitable site visit time.\n\n**Clie