ll be given shortly. Landscaped gardens have different luxuries, for instance, Intercom, Badminton Court, Lift, Water Plant and considerably more. The eye-catching aspect about this project is its nearness to different locales of the city due to which it can offer the best living close to the city yet very far from brisk urban life.\n\n### Sports Amenities\n\n* ![Sports Facility](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804694_sport-facility.svg) Sports Facility\n* ![Kids Play Area](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804595_kids-play-area.svg) Kids Play Area\n* ![Swimming Pool](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804565_swimming-pool.svg) Swimming Pool\n\n### Convenience Amenities\n\n* ![Lifts](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804644_lift.svg) Lifts\n* ![Car Parking](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804679_parking.svg) Car Parking\n* ![Water Storage](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528886749_water_storage.svg) Water Storage\n* ![Waste Disposal](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528886685_waste_disposal.svg) Waste Disposal\n* ![Maintenance Staff](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804773_maintenance-staff.svg) Maintenance Staff\n* ![Wi-fi connectivity](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804529_wifi.svg) Wi-fi connectivity\n* ![Multipurpose Hall](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804708_multipurpose-hall.svg) Multipurpose Hall\n\n## Floor Plans of Evershine Grandeur\n\n![Evershine Grandeur Floor Plan](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/floorplan/41369/1521804903Evershine_Grandeur_2bhk.png \"Evershine Grandeur Floor Plan 1180 sqft\")\n\n2 BHK (1180 Sq. Ft.)\n\nMalad West, Mumbai\n\n## EMI Calculator\n\nLoan Amount (80% of Total Cost) : 2.62 Cr\n\n## Rental Options Available!\n\nExplore rental flats in Godrej E-City\n\n [Check Rental Listings →](http